sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Operator as Operator / Administrator
    participant UI as Web Portal
    participant API as PaymentReceiptsController
    participant Service as PaymentReceiptService
    participant Store as PaymentReceiptStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. SUBMIT CONSOLIDATED PAYMENT RECEIPT
    %% ==========================================

    Operator->>+UI: Record consolidated payment receipt

    Note right of UI: Enter Retailer, received amount and allocations

    Note right of UI: Provide unique OperationKey

    UI->>+API: Confirm(request, operationKey)

    API->>+Service: ConfirmAsync(data, role, actorId, operationKey, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. VALIDATE ACTOR AND REQUEST
    %% ==========================================

    Service->>+Service: NormalizeKey(operationKey)
    Service-->>Service: Normalized OperationKey
    deactivate Service

    Service->>+Service: Validate(data)
    Service-->>Service: Validation result
    deactivate Service

    alt Unauthorized actor or invalid receipt data

        Note right of Service: Return Forbidden or Validation error

    else Actor and receipt data are valid

        %% ==========================================
        %% 3. CHECK IDEMPOTENCY
        %% ==========================================

        Service->>+Store: FindReceiptByOperationKeyAsync(key, false, ct)

        Store->>+DB: SELECT PaymentReceipt WHERE OperationKey = key

        DB-->>Store: Existing receipt or null
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Service: Existing receipt result
        deactivate Store

        alt Receipt with OperationKey already exists

            %% ==========================================
            %% 4. VALIDATE REPLAYED REQUEST
            %% ==========================================

            alt Replayed request matches existing receipt

                Service->>+Service: ToResultAsync(existingReceipt, ct)

                Service->>+Store: ListAllocationsAsync(receiptId, ct)

                Store->>+DB: SELECT PaymentReceiptAllocations

                DB-->>Store: Existing allocations
                deactivate DB

                Store-->>Service: Allocation records
                deactivate Store

                Service-->>Service: Existing PaymentReceiptResult
                deactivate Service

                Note right of Service: Do not create duplicate receipt or allocations

            else OperationKey is reused for different receipt data

                Note right of Service: Return Conflict

            end

        else No receipt with OperationKey exists

            %% ==========================================
            %% 5. START ATOMIC CONFIRMATION
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: ExecuteInTransactionAsync(operation, ct)

            Store->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
            DB-->>Store: Transaction started
            deactivate DB

            Note over Service,DB: All payment allocation updates belong to one transaction

            %% ==========================================
            %% 6. LOAD PAYMENT OBLIGATIONS
            %% ==========================================

            Service->>+Store: FindPaymentsForUpdateAsync(paymentIds, ct)

            Store->>+DB: SELECT Payments and related SalesOrder context

            Note right of DB: Load target obligations for transactional update

            DB-->>Store: Payment obligations and order context
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Service: Payment collection
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 7. VALIDATE PAYMENT ALLOCATIONS
            %% ==========================================

            Note right of Service: Check Retailer ownership and Payment eligibility

            Note right of Service: Validate allocation amounts and total received

            alt Payment missing, wrong Retailer or invalid allocation

                Note right of Service: Reject entire consolidated receipt

                Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                DB-->>Store: Transaction rolled back
                deactivate DB

            else All target Payments are valid

                %% ==========================================
                %% 8. CALCULATE EXISTING ALLOCATIONS
                %% ==========================================

                loop For each target Payment

                    Service->>+Store: ConfirmedAllocationTotalAsync(paymentId, null, ct)

                    Store->>+DB: SELECT SUM(confirmed receipt allocations)

                    Note right of DB: Exclude reversed receipts from confirmed total

                    DB-->>Store: Existing allocated total
                    deactivate DB

                    Store-->>Service: Confirmed allocation amount
                    deactivate Store

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 9. CHECK REMAINING OBLIGATION
                    %% ==========================================

                    Note right of Service: Check new allocation against remaining collectible amount

                end

                %% ==========================================
                %% 10. CHECK TOTAL ALLOCATION
                %% ==========================================

                alt Any allocation exceeds remaining obligation

                    Note right of Service: Reject over-allocation

                    Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                    DB-->>Store: Transaction rolled back
                    deactivate DB

                else Every allocation is valid

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 11. CALCULATE UNAPPLIED CREDIT
                    %% ==========================================

                    Note right of Service: TotalAllocated = sum of requested allocations

                    Note right of Service: UnappliedCredit = ReceivedAmount - TotalAllocated

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 12. CREATE PAYMENT RECEIPT
                    %% ==========================================

                    Note right of Service: Prepare confirmed PaymentReceipt

                    Note right of Service: Record Retailer, reference, amount and OperationKey

                    Service->>+Store: AddReceipt(paymentReceipt)

                    Store-->>Service: PaymentReceipt staged
                    deactivate Store

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 13. CREATE RECEIPT ALLOCATIONS
                    %% ==========================================

                    Note right of Service: Prepare one allocation record per target Payment

                    Service->>+Store: AddAllocations(receiptAllocations)

                    Store-->>Service: PaymentReceiptAllocations staged
                    deactivate Store

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 14. UPDATE DERIVED PAYMENT STATES
                    %% ==========================================

                    loop For each affected Payment

                        Service->>+Service: ApplyDerivedStatus(payment, confirmedTotal, now)

                        Service-->>Service: Updated Payment state
                        deactivate Service

                        Note right of Service: Recalculate confirmed amount and settlement status

                    end

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 15. RECORD AUDIT LOG
                    %% ==========================================

                    Service->>+Store: AddAuditLog(auditLog)

                    Store-->>Service: AuditLog staged
                    deactivate Store

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 16. PERSIST ALL FINANCIAL CHANGES
                    %% ==========================================

                    Service->>+Store: SaveChangesAsync(ct)

                    Store->>+DB: INSERT PaymentReceipt

                    Note right of DB: INSERT PaymentReceiptAllocations and AuditLog

                    Note right of DB: UPDATE affected Payment confirmed amounts and statuses

                    DB-->>Store: Changes saved
                    deactivate DB

                    Store-->>Service: Save successful
                    deactivate Store

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 17. COMMIT TRANSACTION
                    %% ==========================================

                    Store->>+DB: COMMIT

                    DB-->>Store: Transaction committed
                    deactivate DB

                end

            end

            %% ==========================================
            %% 18. RETURN TRANSACTION RESULT
            %% ==========================================

            Store-->>Service: Confirmation outcome or business error
            deactivate Store

            %% ==========================================
            %% 19. BUILD PAYMENT RECEIPT RESULT
            %% ==========================================

            opt Payment Receipt confirmed successfully

                Service->>+Service: ToResultAsync(paymentReceipt, ct)

                Service->>+Store: ListAllocationsAsync(receiptId, ct)

                Store->>+DB: SELECT PaymentReceiptAllocations by ReceiptId

                DB-->>Store: Persisted allocations
                deactivate DB

                Store-->>Service: Allocation details
                deactivate Store

                Service-->>Service: PaymentReceiptResult
                deactivate Service

            end

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 20. RETURN CONFIRMATION RESPONSE
    %% ==========================================

    Service-->>API: PaymentReceiptResult or business error
    deactivate Service

    API-->>UI: Payment Receipt confirmation response
    deactivate API

    UI-->>Operator: Display confirmed receipt and allocation details
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Service,DB: One Receipt can allocate funds to multiple Payment obligations

    Note over Service,DB: Total allocated amount must not exceed ReceivedAmount

    Note over Service,DB: UnappliedCreditAmount retains unallocated received money

    Note over Service,DB: Confirmed Payment balances are recalculated atomically

    Note over Service,DB: Replayed OperationKey must not create duplicate collections

    Note over Service,DB: Receipt confirmation does not change Physical Stock

    Note over Service,DB: Purchase Order and order completion gates are separate workflows